WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.336
Was it my imagination?

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:09.218
Talk to me.

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:11.720
I have visions.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:14.556
I write them down, and...

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.016
people pay to read them.

00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:21.063
Scott had a history of
becoming unstuck...

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.898
to reality.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.775
Where'd you go?

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.068
He called it being "gone".

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.741
Where'd you go?

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:36.828
I don't know how to do this
without you.

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:38.872
Come back.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:53.887
I'm on a bool hunt.

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:55.514
What's a bool hunt?

00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:57.599
Like a scavenger hunt,

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:00.060
Scott and his brother made up
when they were kids.

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:02.271
Mrs. Landon,

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:04.523
I just thought I'd give it
one more try in person.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.985
Scott's unpublished works
need to be collected,

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:08.652
examined--

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.988
You are never
going to see his papers.

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.327
She won't let them go.

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.830
I'll get those papers for you.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:24.251
Scott Landon's books changed me.

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:29.673
Do you remember that night
you asked if I was crazy?

00:01:30.132 --> 00:01:31.049
I believed in it.

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:32.801
That's how strong
his imagination is.

00:01:33.886 --> 00:01:34.803
There's a place.

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:37.723
I'll take you there.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:41.518
What is this?

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:43.478
Where are we?

00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:49.067
If you solve all the riddles,

00:01:49.151 --> 00:01:51.028
find all the clues,

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:52.196
then you get a prize.

00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:54.865
Where we went today,

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.492
was it real?

00:02:01.205 --> 00:02:03.707
Or was it my imagination?

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.255
♪ I said Doctor ♪

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:14.176
♪ Mr. M.D. ♪

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:16.637
♪ Won't you tell me ♪

00:02:18.847 --> 00:02:19.848
♪ What's wrong with me ♪

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:22.976
He's gone,

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.436
but he keeps pushing me.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.270
Toward what?

00:02:35.364 --> 00:02:36.865
Was it real?

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:39.535
Or was it my imagination?

